Dialogue: Marked=0,1:14:31.00,1:14:34.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,的上面
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:14:36.00,1:14:39.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好苗条
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:14:40.01,1:14:43.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妳下面
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:14:43.01,1:14:46.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有毛吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:14:49.02,1:14:52.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:14:52.02,1:14:55.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么没有毛
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:14:55.02,1:14:58.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一直都泼有
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:14:59.03,1:15:02.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,国中就开始剃了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:15:03.00,1:15:06.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,几乎没留过
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:15:06.00,1:15:09.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:15:11.01,1:15:14.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有留长过吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:15:16.01,1:15:19.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会马上剃掉
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:15:19.01,1:15:22.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之后就开始脱毛
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:15:22.02,1:15:25.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再转侧面一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:15:28.02,1:15:31.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是这角度
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:15:31.03,1:15:34.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好清楚
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:15:35.03,1:15:38.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,光溜溜
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:15:40.00,1:15:43.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,男生有吓到过吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:15:46.01,1:15:49.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:15:49.01,1:15:52.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开始都会吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:15:52.01,1:15:55.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有被问过吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:15:55.02,1:15:58.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:15:58.02,1:16:01.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妳都怎么回答
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:01.02,1:16:04.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为不需要
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:05.03,1:16:08.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,了解
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:09.00,1:16:12.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,屁股转过来
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:14.00,1:16:17.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好棒的屁股
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:17.00,1:16:20.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很自卑吗 嗯
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:21.01,1:16:24.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太大了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:24.01,1:16:27.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很漂亮的屁股
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:27.01,1:16:30.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从背后进去很淫荐
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:31.02,1:16:34.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臀围多少
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:35.02,1:16:38.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,88 
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:42.00,1:16:45.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再转回来
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:47.00,1:16:50.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,魔鬼身材
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:52.01,1:16:55.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好害羞
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:55.01,1:16:58.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知进要遮哪边
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:17:01.02,1:17:04.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乳头翘起来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:17:06.02,1:17:09.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:17:09.02,1:17:12.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对观众
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:17:16.00,1:17:19.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发表一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:17:19.00,1:17:22.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自己现在的心情
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:17:25.01,1:17:28.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要桃战很多没体验过
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:17:30.01,1:17:33.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很紧张又不安
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:17:33.01,1:17:36.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我会加油的 请大家支持我 
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:17:41.02,1:17:44.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乳头翘起来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:18:55.03,1:18:58.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妳穿这样好性感
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:00.00,1:19:03.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很小件
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:06.01,1:19:09.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一场要拍什么
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:10.01,1:19:13.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拍口交
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:13.01,1:19:16.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要拍你口交的様子
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:17.02,1:19:20.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你喜欢回交吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:21.02,1:19:24.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非常喜欢
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:25.03,1:19:28.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再说一次非常喜欢
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:28.03,1:19:31.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么喜欢
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:33.00,1:19:36.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢让男生舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:40.01,1:19:43.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喜欢被男生服务
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:45.01,1:19:48.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也喜欢服务男生吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:50.02,1:19:52.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:52.02,1:19:55.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喜欢鸡鸡吗 喜欢
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:55.02,1:19:58.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再说一次 喜欢
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:59.03,1:20:02.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,了解
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:20:02.00,1:20:05.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:20:05.00,1:20:08.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请帮男优舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:20:08.00,1:20:11.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会加油的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:20:11.01,1:20:14.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请多指教
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:20:16.01,1:20:19.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好翘
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:20:19.01,1:20:22.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请让我舒服 失礼了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:20:43.00,1:20:46.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,舌头 好软
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:21:01.02,1:21:04.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:21:18.01,1:21:21.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘴巴好热
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:21:26.01,1:21:29.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好硬 好舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:21:53.01,1:21:56.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能看着我尻枪吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:22:07.02,1:22:10.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乳头舒服吗 舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:22:16.00,1:22:19.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这边舔乳头边尻
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:22:31.01,1:22:34.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:22:53.00,1:22:56.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:23:06.01,1:23:09.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,露出来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:23:09.02,1:23:12.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,摸我
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:23:21.03,1:23:24.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好漂亮的咪咪
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:23:26.00,1:23:29.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以蹭吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:23:46.02,1:23:49.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好舒服' 
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:24:13.01,1:24:16.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:24:19.02,1:24:22.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帮我夹
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:25:28.02,1:25:31.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用嘴巴就好
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:26:07.03,1:26:10.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,舔蛋蛋
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:26:32.02,1:26:35.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:26:55.01,1:26:58.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看这边
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:27:16.00,1:27:19.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吃
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:27:24.01,1:27:27.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鸡鸡好吃吗 好吃
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:27:41.02,1:27:44.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:27:46.03,1:27:49.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,舔龟头 
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:27:57.00,1:28:00.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,含到底
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:28:24.00,1:28:27.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吸给我听
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:28:40.01,1:28:43.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:29:39.01,1:29:42.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:32.03,1:30:35.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:37.00,1:30:40.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪里舒服 
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:40.00,1:30:43.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那边 这吗 
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:51.01,1:30:54.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尽量射
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:31:13.00,1:31:16.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要射了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:13.03,1:32:16.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,射好多
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:16.03,1:32:19.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很多 
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:21.00,1:32:24.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吃
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:25.01,1:32:28.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看妳真得很喜欢口
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:31.01,1:32:34.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喜欢 
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:44.03,1:32:47.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再来
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:48.03,1:32:51.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要拍什么呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:51.00,1:32:54.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拍我自慰
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:54.00,1:32:57.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:57.00,1:33:00.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妳一个礼拜自慰几几次
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:02.01,1:33:05.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,10次 
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:05.01,1:33:08.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,7天中 
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:10.02,1:33:13.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有一天两次的时候
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:14.02,1:33:17.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:18.03,1:33:21.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很频繁呢?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:22.03,1:33:25.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妳都怎么自慰
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:25.00,1:33:28.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用按摩棒在旁边?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:28.00,1:33:31.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好多
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:31.01,1:33:34.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我准备了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:35.01,1:33:38.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很多种
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:40.01,1:33:43.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要用哪根都行
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:44.02,1:33:47.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,里面有喜欢的吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:48.02,1:33:51.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:52.03,1:33:55.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其他的不要吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:57.00,1:34:00.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这我有
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:34:00.00,1:34:03.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是喔粉红色的?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:34:04.01,1:34:07.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有些还有颗粒
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:34:07.01,1:34:10.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这很重要
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:34:11.01,1:34:14.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要有颗粒吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:34:14.02,1:34:17.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 有讲'究
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:34:18.02,1:34:21.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,了解?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:34:21.02,1:34:24.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自慰?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:34:24.03,1:34:27.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,通常都自己做吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:34:29.03,1:34:32.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在有我在?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:34:34.00,1:34:37.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想让妳独处
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:34:37.00,1:34:40.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也会出去?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:34:41.01,1:34:44.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就照平常那样自慰?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:34:49.02,1:34:52.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我出去了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:34:52.02,1:34:55.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想怎么做都行?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:34:58.03,1:35:01.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以吗 嗯?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:35:04.00,1:35:07.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想性幻想也行
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:35:10.00,1:35:13.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,交给你了?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:35:14.01,1:35:17.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:35:17.01,1:35:20.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我出去就能开始了?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:43:57.00,1:44:00.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好舒服?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:44:10.01,1:44:13.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要去了?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:44:25.03,1:44:28.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要去了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:45:38.00,1:45:41.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要去了?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:46:54.01,1:46:57.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:47:01.02,1:47:04.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结束了吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:47:08.02,1:47:11.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:47:11.03,1:47:14.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,声音很清楚
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:47:15.03,1:47:18.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实在隔壁
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:47:18.00,1:47:21.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有萤幕可以看妳?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:47:22.00,1:47:25.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我全程看完了?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:47:28.01,1:47:31.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有用手指吧 
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:47:34.02,1:47:37.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有用紫色的?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:47:40.02,1:47:43.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好高潮吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:47:43.02,1:47:46.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用不习惯
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:47:46.03,1:47:49.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,频率不合吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:47:51.00,1:47:54.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,后来换粉红色的?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:47:56.00,1:47:59.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,手指也插进去就高潮了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:48:00.01,1:48:03.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很真实的自慰?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:48:03.01,1:48:06.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没叫出来?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:48:06.01,1:48:09.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,心跳好快
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:48:09.02,1:48:12.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还在喘
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:48:13.02,1:48:16.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是黑色的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:48:16.02,1:48:19.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应较习惯 
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:48:19.03,1:48:22.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:48:23.03,1:48:26.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先把妹妹扒开我看看
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:48:27.00,1:48:30.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没仔细看过
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:48:30.00,1:48:33.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:48:36.01,1:48:39.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阴蒂硬梆梆了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:48:40.01,1:48:43.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,湿嗒嗒
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:48:43.02,1:48:46.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很舒服 
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:48:46.02,1:48:49.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,观众可能看不到
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:48:49.02,1:48:52.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阴蒂红通通
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:48:52.03,1:48:55.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太激烈了I 
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:48:55.03,1:48:58.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,平常都这样自慰吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:48:58.00,1:49:01.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 一个礼拜十次
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:49:03.00,1:49:06.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好淫荡
